  "track_limits": "21.1 In accordance with the provisions of Article 33.3 of the Sporting Regulations, the white lines\ndefine the track edges. During Qualifying and the Race, each time a driver fails to negotiate\nwith the track limits, this will result in that lap time being invalidated by the Stewards.\nAdditionally, each time a driver fails to negotiate the turns 18 or and 19, will result in that lap\ntime and the immediately following lap time may be invalidated by the Stewards.\n21.2 Run-off in Turn 1-2-3\nAny driver who fails to negotiate Turn 2 by using the track, and who passes completely to the\nright of the orange kerb/line element, must keep to the right of the red and white polystyrene\nblock, and re-join the track on the outside of Turn 3.",
